flowchart TB
    %% Placement overview. Service links, ACLs and cabling have dedicated views.
    WAN["Zen fibre<br/>Openreach ONT"] -->|"eth1 · PPPoE"| Router["GL-MT6000 · OpenWrt<br/>192.168.10.1<br/>Gateway · firewall · DNS · NTP"]
    subgraph Compute["PROXMOX · 192.168.10.10 · 64 GiB RAM"]
        direction TB
        Home["HOME CONTROL + AI<br/>VM100 Home Assistant · .20.101<br/>CT114 llama.cpp / voice · .20.104"]
        Apps["HOUSEHOLD SERVICES<br/>VM103 docker-host · .20.102<br/>Apps · Homepage · Tailscale"]
        Ops["MONITORING + NVR<br/>VM102 monitoring · .60.10<br/>CT111 Frigate · .30.20"]
        Old["VM101 + VM104<br/>Powered-off rollback only"]
        Home ~~~ Apps ~~~ Ops ~~~ Old
    end
    subgraph Storage["STORAGE · VLAN40"]
        direction TB
        NAS["OMV NAS · 192.168.40.50<br/>NFS + SMB · media + backups"]
        Consumers["Serves Proxmox, HA and VM103<br/>Frigate recording mount retained<br/>Backup success is not restore proof"]
        NAS --- Consumers
    end
    subgraph Physical["PHYSICAL INTEGRATIONS"]
        direction TB
        Hive["LAN2 · VLAN55 · Hive .55.10<br/>Internet verified · app issue open"]
        CCTV["LAN3 · Zyxel + 3 ANNKE cameras<br/>Intentionally disconnected<br/>Fourth camera remains future work"]
        Workshop["P1S · VLAN35 · not commissioned<br/>VentSys · VLAN50 · hardware pending"]
        Hive ~~~ CCTV ~~~ Workshop
    end
    Router ---|"LAN1 · VLAN trunk"| Compute
    Router ---|"LAN4 · VLAN40"| Storage
    Router ---|"See physical cabling view"| Physical
    class Router,Home,Apps,Ops core
    class NAS,Consumers store
    class Old,CCTV,Workshop deferred
    class Hive policy

    classDef core fill:#143747,stroke:#63c9bd,color:#eefbfa
    classDef store fill:#292745,stroke:#aa99db,color:#f2edff
    classDef policy fill:#2f301f,stroke:#c7bc77,color:#fff9d8
    classDef deferred fill:#1b2638,stroke:#9dabc1,color:#d3dfef,stroke-dasharray:5 4
